admen keep the lookout from blowing over. The lookout was extensively damaged in a 2006 storm, along with Mount Fremont Fire Lookout, with both since being repaired.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gobbler's_Knob_Fire_Lookout","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","attribution":"Wikipedia"},"photos":[{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Gobblers_Knob_Fire_Lookout_%28cfb15fd1-8a9d-4fa0-b6bd-62e9cfe0cff3%29.jpg/960px-Gobblers_Knob_Fire_Lookout_%28cfb15fd1-8a9d-4fa0-b6bd-62e9cfe0cff3%29.jpg","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gobblers_Knob_Fire_Lookout_(cfb15fd1-8a9d-4fa0-b6bd-62e9cfe0cff3).jpg","dist_m":9,"width":640,"height":480,"license":"Public domain","license_url":"","artist":"NPS Photo"},{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6a/Gobblers_Knob_Fire_Lookout_%2853d37363-c139-473d-bf0c-30cdb134a9fb%29.jpg/960px-Gobblers_Knob_Fire_Lookout_%2853d37363-c139-473d-bf0c-30cdb134a9fb%29.jpg","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gobblers_Knob_Fire_Lookout_(53d37363-c139-473d-bf0c-30cdb134a9fb).jpg","dist_m":13,"width":640,"height":480,"license":"Public domain","license_url":"","artist":"NPS Photo"},{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ad/Gobblers_Knob_Fire_Lookout_%280b0323fc-a5ea-4f9e-9926-1fb075bc0085%29.jpg/960px-Gobblers_Knob_Fire_Lookout_%280b0323fc-a5ea-4f9e-9926-1fb075bc0085%29.jpg","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gobblers_Knob_Fire_Lookout_(0b0323fc-a5ea-4f9e-9926-1fb075bc0085).jpg","dist_m":13,"width":640,"height":480,"license":"Public domain","license_url":"","artist":"NPS Photo"},{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/19/Gobblers_Knob_Fire_Lookout_%2807e020c8-eaa1-421f-bbf0-8d2a852186d9%29.jpg/960px-Gobblers_Knob_Fire_Lookout_%2807e020c8-eaa1-421f-bbf0-8d2a852186d9%29.jpg","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gobblers_Knob_Fire_Lookout_(07e020c8-eaa1-421f-bbf0-8d2a852186d9).jpg","dist_m":13,"width":640,"height":480,"li